{"id":"infeliz","lemma":"infeliz","pos":"adj","rank":2607,"glosses":["unhappy","unfortunate"],"ipa":"/infeˈliθ/","forms":{"femininePlural":"infelices"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/77/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-infeliz.wav","examples":[{"text":"Los pobres no siempre son infelices.","en":"The poor are not always unhappy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/788357","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"poor","l":"pobre"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Yo no era infeliz.","en":"I wasn't unhappy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442824","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Él vivió una vida infeliz.","en":"He lived an unhappy life.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to live","l":"vivir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"life"},null]},{"text":"¿Por qué es Tom tan infeliz?","en":"What's Tom so unhappy about?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333181","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"so, as"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why, for what reason"]]},{"text":"Nunca somos tan felices o tan infelices como imaginamos.","en":"We are never as happy nor as unhappy as we imagine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691634","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"so, as"},{"g":"happy, merry","l":"feliz"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"so, as"},null,{"g":"as"},{"g":"to imagine","l":"imaginar"}]}]}